alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7157318.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Customer-Centric Planning team is looking for a Senior Data Analyst with an engineering mindset. You will not only be a user of data but also a builder of data infrastructure. This position highly integrates Data Analysis and Analytics Engineering. You will be responsible for maintaining Airflow ETL processes from multiple internal data sources such as Zendesk, WMS (Warehouse Management System), and OMS (Order Management System), and utilizing Python and AI tools for automation development to support the operation and optimize the experience of teams such as Supplier Support, Customer Support, and Andon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;This is not just a &quot;report-running&quot; job. In the Customer-Centric Planning team, you will:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;ordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Delve into underlying technologies: Directly operate Airflow and Presto clusters, participating in the complete lifecycle from Raw Data to Insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Embrace new technologies: We actively introduce AI (Windsurf, Gemini, Copilot) and automation tools to eliminate repetitive tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly support (within hours) and respond to the needs of various operational teams, formulate Ad-Hoc analysis plans, and produce high-quality, highly accurate data reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Pain Point Analysis and Root Cause Analysis: Building a customer experience funnel, identifying process issues and operational problems from the user lifecycle, and analyzing deep-seated causes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-End Data Pipeline Construction and Maintenance (ETL &amp;amp; Pipeline): Using Presto/Hive SQL to process large-scale data, responsible for designing and maintaining Airflow DAGs, developing and optimizing Data Marts, monitoring data pipeline health, and ensuring data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process Automation and Tool Development (Automation &amp;amp; Tooling): Using Python to develop automation scripts, integrating Slack, GitHub, Zendesk, Tableau, Presto, Confluence, and various internal APIs, and using/introducing LangChain, MCP Server to achieve automated updates and releases for various research, report generation, Quality Assurance, etc., reducing manual intervention and improving team efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;3+ years of data analysis or data engineering experience, with the ability to handle complex SQL queries (Recursive CTE, Window Functions, JSON parsing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Possess business analysis sensitivity, capable of transforming vague business problems (e.g., &quot;Why are customer complaints increasing?&quot;) into concrete data analysis projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiar with Tableau Server, Power BI, or related report creation and operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiar with customer service and ticketing system operational data structures: experience in data analysis for similar systems such as customer service, e-commerce, and logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Possess e-commerce or supply chain domain knowledge: understanding of e-commerce business models and logistics inventory logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Possess practical Python development skills, capable of writing automation scripts, handling API integration, or performing data transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiar with Airflow or similar workflow scheduling tools, with practical experience in writing and maintaining DAGs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiar with version control tools (GitHub/Git), accustomed to Pull Request (PR) review and collaboration processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI/LLM application experience: experience using LangChain or internal AI tools to build auxiliary analysis agents or automated processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Details to Consider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
