&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXO78534918 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXO78534918 BCX0&quot;&gt;Ability to travel (roving) amongst a portfolio of properties within Northern Virginia &amp;amp; DC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;What You Bring to Us:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;joblist&quot;&gt;
