&lt;li data-start=&quot;1301&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1303&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;Create a wide range of technical content including product guides, code samples, tutorials, demos, blogs, and design specs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1427&quot; data-end=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1429&quot; data-end=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;Translate complex engineering concepts into clear, digestible documentation for different audiences (developers, stakeholders, end users).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1655&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1570&quot; data-end=&quot;1655&quot;&gt;Lead pilots to experiment with content types and formats to improve product adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1656&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1658&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;Define and support the content strategy across SGTS and GCC initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1731&quot; data-end=&quot;1830&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1733&quot; data-end=&quot;1830&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineers, designers, and product managers to align messaging and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1831&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1833&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Continuously improve and refresh existing documentation for accuracy and usability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1917&quot; data-end=&quot;1992&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;1992&quot;&gt;Stay up to date with industry trends and bring in content best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1994&quot; data-end=&quot;2021&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1994&quot; data-end=&quot;2021&quot;&gt;Products You’ll Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2022&quot; data-end=&quot;2160&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2022&quot; data-end=&quot;2054&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2024&quot; data-end=&quot;2054&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2024&quot; data-end=&quot;2037&quot;&gt;SHIP-HATS&lt;/strong&gt; – CI/CD platform&lt;/p&gt;
