&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Medical Plan Coverage provided by Colmédica&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Plan Coverage provided by Pan American&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Hybrid Allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Additional Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Maternity Leave 18 weeks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Parental/Paternity Leave 2 mandatory weeks + 4 weeks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mental Health and Resiliency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
